    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PRISMIDIA: Spirit of the Rift is a sci-fi shoot 'em up game in the style of arcade classics.  Dodge barrages of attacks, survive bullet hell bosses, and save Prismidia!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595820/extras/be11ea54839969e6e467ad0d7f181b2a.avif?t=1754336593\" width=800 height=266 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A great energy lies at the heart of Prismidia.  For as long as anyone can remember, the spirits have protected it.  Until one day... a rift appeared in their defenses.  Alien forces poured into the system, swarming the planets.  With the seventh spirit missing, it's up to the six remaining spirits to restore balance to Prismidia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595820/extras/96d176ec3febc580dfdd680b7a74a405.avif?t=1754336593\" width=800 height=266 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience arcade-style shoot 'em up action and bullet hell bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer 7 stages, each in a new alien environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 6 playable characters, each with their own style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select one of 5 difficulty settings, ranging from Novice to Ultra</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn stages and bosses using a fully featured Practice mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate your view with optional tate support (for players with a rotated monitor)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy all original pixel art and music, lovingly hand crafted without AI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595820/extras/eda74036e2474aea9f13d5871d026eb9.avif?t=1754336593\" width=800 height=266 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Us</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi!  We're Chain Damage Games, a husband-and-wife team making Prismidia.  We love retro games, shmups, and pixel art!  We can't wait to share more with you.</p>",
