/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595820/extras/eda74036e2474aea9f13d5871d026eb9.avif?t=1754336593\" width=800 height=266 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Us</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi!  We're Chain Damage Games, a husband-and-wife team making Prismidia.  We love retro games, shmups, and pixel art!  We can't wait to share more with you.</p>",
